er wire and strips\", \"Enamelled aluminium wires and strips\", \"Submersible winding wires\", \"Multi-layered submersible winding wires\", \"Fiber glass covered copper and aluminium strips\", \"Paper cover round wires\", \"Super fine wires (down to 0.016 mm)\", \"Advanced litz wires\", \"Kapton-covered litz wires (EV charging)\", \"MCB coils of enamelled strips\", \"Parallel wires for EV hub motor windings\"], \"Copper tubes & pipes\": [\"Level Wound Coils (LWC)\", \"Inner Grooved Tubes (IGT)\", \"Pancake Coils (PCC)\", \"Straight copper tubes\", \"Capillary tubes\", \"PVC-coated …","promises":[],"promises_total":0,"promoters":"","related":"[{\"name\": \"Tefabo Product Pvt. Ltd. (TPPL)\", \"relation\": \"subsidiary\", \"note\": \"64% owned (raised via acquisition of an additional 4% equity during the year); manufactures fabricated components and assemblies for the renewable energy sector, strengthening the parent's green energy portfolio\"}, …","risks":[{"note":"Efficient use of raw materials, particularly copper, is critical for the resource-intensive winding-wire and copper-tube operations; inefficient consumption directly erodes margins and strains supply resilience.","risk":"Copper raw-material intensity and price volatility"},{"note":"Energy consumption remains a major driver of manufacturing costs, and efficiency investments are needed to stay aligned with evolving environmental regulations and climate commitments.","risk":"Energy cost and emissions exposure"},{"note":"Manufacturing operations inherently carry workplace risks; strong safety systems are essential for workforce protection and statutory compliance, with failures risking legal and financial penalties.","risk":"Occupational health and safety in manufacturing"},{"note":"The supply chain is a significant source of indirect environmental and social impact; vendor failure to adhere to ESG standards can cause supply disruptions, reputational damage, and financial penalties.","risk":"Supply-chain / vend